d_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past Tense and Past Continuous tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the Simple Past tense to talk about events that are finished. You use the Past Continuous to talk about events or an action that was happening at a time in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Simple Past tense verbs can be regular or irregular.</p> Regular verbs end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span> or <span class=\"strong\">-ied</span>.</p> Irregular verbs change in different ways.</p> For Past Continuous, we add <span class=\"strong\">was/were</span> + verb\u201c<span class=\"strong\">ing</span>\u201d to verbs."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"try\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tried\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were trying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"overcharge\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"overcharged\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were overcharging\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"said\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were saying\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shake\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"shook\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were shaking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"give\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"gave\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were giving\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were going\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"buy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were buying\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I was going to pay the full price when the guide stopped me."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I think the shop owner was trying to overcharge you. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "keychain"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an object you use to keep your keys together"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought this pyramid keychain in Cairo!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about a vacation."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "souvenir"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an item you keep as a reminder of a place or event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The tourists bought a lot of souvenirs at the Pyramids."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tourist trap"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a shop that sells items, often overpriced, for tourists"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A lot of shops near historical monuments are tourist traps."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to overcharge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make someone pay an excessive price for a service or an item"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think the shop owner overcharged you for that keychain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "delicacy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "expensive food, typical of a country or place, often used as a gift"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I tried caviar when I visited Russia. It's a delicacy!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dates"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the fruit of the date palm tree"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Dates are a delicacy in many parts of the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "steeped"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "filled with a particular quality"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The streets of Cairo are steeped in history."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to haggle "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fight over the price of something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Did you have to haggle to buy that keychain?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob07aud08"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue with a partner (10-12 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You want to buy a souvenir at a tourist shop."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The price is too high, so you decide to argue with the shop owner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Decide on a price and pay. Did the shop owner give you a discount? Did they overcharge you?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about travel and transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what I was doing when something happened."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare things and prices."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give an opinion."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: That's a nice keychain! Where did you get it?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I bought it in a souvenir shop near the Pyramids.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Those guys must be millionaires with all the visitors every day!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah, I guess ... The shop was a bit of a tourist trap, but I couldn't resist! Giza is steeped in history!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Did you haggle over the price of that keychain?!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob07re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Not at first. I was planning to pay the full price when the tour guide stopped me.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally's Mom</span>: Was the shop owner trying to overcharge you?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure ... I didn't understand what they were saying!</br>\n<span cla